  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0046.p05",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "＞ちかいますか？",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0047.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ランタン：ヒーホー！そうか、そうか！{n}やったー、ジャアクなデビルバスターを{n}こらしめたぞ！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0047.p01",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "フロスト：しめたぞー！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0047.p02",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ランタン：ヒーホー！ヒーホー！おれたち、{n}むてきのデビルバスター・バスターズ！{n}ヒーホー！ヒーホー！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0047.p03",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "フロスト：ヒーホー！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0048.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ランタン：ヒーホー！{n}おれたちに、はむかうなんて{n}イイどきょうだな！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0048.p01",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "フロスト：だなー！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0048.p02",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ランタン：ようし、やっつけてやる！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0048.p03",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "フロスト：やるー！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0049.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ランタン：ようし、かわいそうだから、{n}きょうは、このへんにしといてやる。{n}じゃあな！ヒーホー！ヒーホー！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0050.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "タカシ：よお、なんとか戦ってるようだな。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0051.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "だが、見られた戦いぶりじゃねぇ。{n}1ついいことを教えてやろう。{n}事務所に戻って、奥の部屋に入ってみな。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0051.p01",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "魔法を1つ覚えられるぜ。{n}といっても、おまえは魔法が使えねぇから、{n}レイに覚えてもらうんだな。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0051.p02",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "あばよ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0052.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "右の悪魔：よくぞ来られた。{n}汝、葛葉キョウジの身体を借る魂、{n}{last_name}{first_name}よ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0052.p01",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "我はホクトセイクン。{n}七星の下に、人間どもの死を司っておる。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0052.p02",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "左の悪魔：わしはナントセイクン。{n}人間たちの、生の面倒をみておる。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0052.p03",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ホクトセイクン：この奥は、{n}悪魔どもの太極たる場所。{n}最強の悪魔どもが巣食うておる。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0052.p04",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ナントセイクン：それでも汝が{n}この先に進まんとするならば、{n}この道を開けてやらんでもない。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0052.p05",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ホクトセイクン：だがそれは、{n}我らが汝の力を、認めたならばの話。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0052.p06",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ナントセイクン：満ちたる月が{n}絶え入る前に、わしらを倒すことが{n}出来るならばな。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0052.p07",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ナントセイクン：さあ、いかが致す。{n}悪魔召喚師殿。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0052.p08",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "＞戦いますか？",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0053.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ナントセイクン：またも来られたか、{n}悪魔召喚師殿。{n}我らと戦うのか？",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0053.p01",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "＞戦いますか？",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0054.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ホクトセイクン：では参られい。{n}汝、流転する魂、{last_name}{first_name}よ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0055.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ホクトセイクン：御見事であった。{n}汝の器量であれば、この先を進むことも{n}可能であろう。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0055.p01",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ナントセイクン：では行かれるがよい。{n}くれぐれも達者でな。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0056.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ホクトセイクン：……残念だが、{n}このくらいの力量では{n}ここを通すわけにはいかぬな。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0056.p01",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ナントセイクン：まあ、今日のところは{n}わしらの攻めに果てなかったことを{n}よしとするがよい。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0056.p02",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ホクトセイクン：では、戻られい。{n}己を鍛え直したなら、また来られよ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0057.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ナントセイクン：うむ、それもよかろう。{n}何も急ぐ事は無いわ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0058.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "＞向こうへ行きますか？",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0059.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ナントセイクン：ここから出るのかな？{n}{last_name}殿。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0059.p01",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "＞ここから出ますか？",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0060.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ホクトセイクン：では、さらばだ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0061.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ホクトセイクン：そうか。{n}では、戻るがよい。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0062.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ホームレスの男：よお、あんた葛葉キョウジ{n}だけど、ホントは{last_name}{first_name}だろ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0062.p01",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "なんだか、地下もさわがしくなってきてよお{n}かなわんぜ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0062.p02",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "こうやって、かなアミがあって通れねぇ{n}とこがイッパイあっけどよお、{n}そのうち、通れるようになるぜ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0063.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "まあ、がんばってくれや。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0064.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "よおし、そろそろ、いいだろう。{n}この奥に行ってみな。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0065.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "キョウジ：まて、おれの装備を取っていく。{n}こっちだ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0066.p00",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_event_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "キョウジ：ここには、おれの武器や防具を{n}集めておいた。おれは、これを装備して戦う",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.evfile_2.m0067.p00",
